{"annotations": {"list": []}, "editable": true, "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0, "graphTooltip": 0, "links": [], "panels": [{"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "description": "Backpressure rule (server-enforced, see docs/api.md).", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {}, "overrides": []}, "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0}, "id": 1, "options": {"content": "## Backpressure rule\nWhile queue `depth > threshold` (default 500, env `TASKMESH_QUEUE_THRESHOLD`), job submissions with `priority < 5` are rejected with `429 BACKPRESSURE` and counted in `taskmesh_jobs_rejected_backpressure_total` / `rejectedTotal`. High-priority jobs (5-10) are always admitted. Watch **Queue depth** vs **Backpressure rejections** below.", "mode": "markdown"}, "title": "Backpressure rule", "type": "text"}, {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps"}, "overrides": []}, "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4}, "id": 2, "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "none"}}, "targets": [{"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum(rate(taskmesh_jobs_submitted_total[5m]))", "legendFormat": "submitted", "refId": "A"}], "title": "Jobs submitted rate", "type": "timeseries"}, {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps"}, "overrides": []}, "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4}, "id": 3, "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "none"}}, "targets": [{"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(taskmesh_jobs_completed_total[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}", "refId": "A"}], "title": "Jobs completed by outcome", "type": "timeseries"}, {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "fieldConfig": {"